# Frontend

- App Router; Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for interactivity.
- Match existing patterns in `LessonPlayer` and diagrams.
- Strict TypeScript; extend `src/types/lesson.ts` carefully.
- Use `cn` from `@/lib/cn`; Motion from `motion/react`.
- Verify current Next/React docs when APIs may have changed (`technical-research`).
